  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0:\n- Migrado de Newtonsoft.Json para System.Text.Json (zero dependencias externas)\n- Adicionado suporte a PUT (PutAsync)\n- Novos modulos: PaymentLink, Pix, Notification, CreditBureauReport, CustomerFiscalInfo\n- Novos endpoints em managers existentes: UndoReceivedInCash, ListPaymentBook, ListPayments, Find transfer, SignAgreement, PaymentStatistics, SplitStatistics, FindAccountNumber, MobilePhoneRecharge webhooks\n- Corrigido path de Balance (/finance/balance)\n- Invoice Update agora usa PUT corretamente\n- 400 testes unitarios",
